# Generated detector tables. Owned end-to-end by scripts/repo/gen/, which emits
# deterministic 2-space JSON so `data-is-regenerated` can diff committed bytes
# against a fresh generation. oxfmt collapses short arrays onto one line, which
# would make the formatter and the generator permanently disagree: format,
# drift-check fails, regenerate, format again. Per the fleet rule that
# generated artifacts are never format-gated, the generator is the sole
# formatter of this tree.
**/data/**
